// The derived answer the demo's agent watches: enterprise customers with an
// unresolved failed payment. `customer` comes from Postgres CDC, `payment_issue`
// from billing webhooks; the join is re-evaluated on each query and after each
// relevant commit for the standing query, so it reflects either change.
+needs_attention(Id, Name, Invoice) <- customer(Id, Name, "enterprise"), payment_issue(Invoice, Id, _)
